{"id":"12979","t":{"th":"นารูโตะ Rock Lee & His Ninja Pals","ro":"NARUTO SD Rock Lee no Seishun Full-Power Ninden","en":"NARUTO Spin-Off: Rock Lee & His Ninja Pals","na":"NARUTOナルトSD ロック・リーの青春フルパワー忍伝","thShared":true},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b12979-ToE4ShcCGngP.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b12979-ToE4ShcCGngP.jpg","color":"#e49343","banner":null,"fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":51,"dur":24,"season":"SPRING","year":2012,"start":"2012-04-03","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Comedy"],"score":67,"pop":20256,"studio":"","desc":"Welcome to the Hidden Leaf Village. The village where Uzumaki Naruto, star of the TV show \"Naruto\" makes his home. Every day, countless powerful ninjas carry out missions and train to hone their skills. Our main character is one of these powerful ninjas...but it's not Naruto! It's the ninja who can't use ninjutsu, Rock Lee! In spite of his handicap, Lee has big dreams. He works hard every day to perfect his hand-to-hand combat skills and become a splendid ninja! And to achieve his dream, he puts in more effort than anyone else. Under the hot-blooded tutelage of his teacher Guy, he works alongside his teammates Tenten and Neji. Watch the Beautiful Green Beast Rock Lee train, go on missions, and have all sorts of adventures!","descTh":"ยินดีต้อนรับสู่หมู่บ้านใบไม้ที่ซ่อนอยู่ หมู่บ้านที่อุซึมากิ นารูโตะ ดาราจากรายการทีวี \"นารูโตะ\" อาศัยอยู่ที่บ้านของเขา ทุกๆ วัน นินจาผู้ทรงพลังจำนวนนับไม่ถ้วนจะทำภารกิจและฝึกฝนเพื่อฝึกฝนทักษะของพวกเขา ตัวละครหลักของเราคือหนึ่งในนินจาที่ทรงพลัง...แต่ไม่ใช่นารูโตะ! นินจานี่แหละที่ไม่สามารถใช้วิชานินจาได้ ร็อค ลี! แม้ว่าเขาจะพิการ แต่ลีก็มีความฝันอันยิ่งใหญ่ เขาทำงานหนักทุกวันเพื่อฝึกฝนทักษะการต่อสู้แบบประชิดตัวให้สมบูรณ์แบบและกลายเป็นนินจาที่ยอดเยี่ยม! และเพื่อให้บรรลุความฝันเขาจึงทุ่มเทความพยายามมากกว่าใครๆ ภายใต้การดูแลอย่างเลือดร้อนของอาจารย์กาย เขาทำงานร่วมกับเพื่อนร่วมทีมเท็นเท็นและเนจิ ชมรถไฟ Green Beast Rock Lee แสนสวย ทำภารกิจ และผจญภัยทุกประเภท!","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":null,"al":"https://anilist.co/anime/12979","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/12979","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"crunchyroll","r":"TH","u":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/series/GR9PV4ED6","lang":"en","eps":[["51","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GRJQ055EY/the-final-battle--our-final-mission-is-s-ranked",1364288400,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/4ce87ecc1b47a428b14a1439cbce8432.png",null,{"d":1400,"a":"premium","fin":1}],["50","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GR49PZZW6/babysitting-guy-sensei--lady-tsunades-marriage-interview",1363683600,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/f1ecd5abbdb242e40652b59e5e702c81.png",null,{"d":1430,"a":"premium"}],["49","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GR9PV4486/the-alliance-to-destroy-white-day--clean-up-the-dolls",1363078800,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/50b000b37e01cf844d00905900901d9a.png",null,{"d":1430,"a":"premium"}],["48","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GYE5XNN8R/yamato-gets-a-mission--leaf-village-of-the-dead",1362474000,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/a99cbd72cf72487c542b41ccf016e720.png",null,{"d":1430,"a":"premium"}],["47","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GYGG5332Y/dogs-need-dog-friends--its-him",1361869200,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/6d5b9160668287f3003eaf37f9d4de8c.png",null,{"d":1430,"a":"premium"}],["46","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/G65VP55E6/the-legendary-sannin-jiraiya--infiltrate-the-womens-bath",1361264400,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/8c544a2c871d826a4f7a0d87e79fb0ac.png",null,{"d":1430,"a":"premium"}],["45","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GRDQK11DY/a-firey-snow-sculpting-contest--the-battlefield-called-valentines-day",1360659600,"x","c:600x338/catalog/crunchyroll/f5448afc5551755e14f6cf50f3f6aa01.png",null,{"d":1430,"a":"premium"}],["44","https://www.crunchyroll.com/th/watch/GY8VD99DY/the-staff-will-eat-the-beans-aftewards--the-raikage-is-un